Measure where a frame's time goes

Usage: game.exe perf [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --frames <FRAMES>
          [default: 600]
      --sdk <SDK>
          Portable SDK root (otherwise environment or executable-relative discovery)
      --project <PROJECT>
          [default: .]
      --seed <SEED>
          [default: 42]
      --input-sequence <INPUT_SEQUENCE>
          
      --json
          
  -h, --help
          Print help
